  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Basic Education Support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">St&#xF6;d till basutbildning - Undervisningsst&#xF6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till basutbildning kanaliserat genom en Education Sector Support Fund (basket fund)med Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports in Sierra Leone som genomf&#xF6;rare.St&#xF6;det baseras p&#xE5; arbetsplaner som fr&#xE4;mst inneh&#xE5;ller rehabiltering och nybyggnation av skolor,  distribution av l&#xE4;romedel, utbildning av l&#xE4;rare, samt utveckling av funktioner f&#xF6;r samordning och ledning inom sektorn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to basic education channelled through an Education Sector Support Fund (basket fund) with the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports as implementing agency. The support is based on work plans which mainly contains rehabilitation/construction of schools, distribution of teaching and learning materials, training of teacher as well as development coordination and management.</narrative>
  </description>
